Razer Pro Type Ultra (Wired 1532:0277, Wireless 1532:027B)

From https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer/pull/2888 by iacoviola (head
0091debab37f9a25474585dc70931f0c1263aec5), open upstream since 2026-08-17 and
tested there on the keyboard itself.  Rebased onto master ea55c1b, where the
Blade 18 (2026) and the BlackWidow V4 Low-profile Tenkeyless HyperSpeed had
taken the same spots in the lists.  Only the driver and daemon files the
generators read are kept; the README, udev, appstream and fake-driver hunks
are left out.

Delete this file once upstream master carries the pull request.

